30107      options nosyntaxcheck obs=max firstobs=1 nodate nonumber nocenter linesize=160 pagesize=max nostimer nofullstimer validvarname=v7
30107    ! validmemname=compatible locale=en_US;
30108      %let syscc=0;
30109      title; footnote;
30110      ods _all_ close;
30111      ods listing gpath="%sysfunc(pathname(work))";
30112      ods graphics off;
30113      proc datasets library=work kill nolist;
NOTE: Deleting WORK.OUTV (memtype=DATA).
NOTE: Deleting WORK.REGSTRY (memtype=ITEMSTOR).
NOTE: File WORK.REGSTRY (memtype=ITEMSTOR) cannot be deleted because it is in use.
NOTE: Deleting WORK.SASGOPT (memtype=CATALOG).
