NOTE: Deleting WORK._ORACLE_INPUT (memtype=DATA).
30113    !                                         quit;


30114      ods path work.templat(update) sashelp.tmplmst(read);
30115      
30116      title 'Spatial Correlation Analysis with PROC VARIOGRAM';
30117      ods graphics on;
30118      proc variogram data=sashelp.thick plots=pairs(thr=30);
30119      compute novariogram nhc=20;
30120      coordinates xc=East yc=North;
30121      var Thick;
30122      run;

NOTE: The PROCEDURE VARIOGRAM printed page 1834.

30123      proc variogram data=sashelp.thick outv=outv;
30124      compute lagd=7 maxlag=10 cl robust;
30125      coordinates xc=East yc=North;
30126      var Thick;
30127      run;

NOTE: No DIRECTIONS statement and no NDIRECTIONS=, or NDIRECTIONS=0 specified: Computing omnidirectional semivariogram.
NOTE: The data set WORK.OUTV has 12 observations and 9 variables.
NOTE: The PROCEDURE VARIOGRAM printed pages 1835-1836.

30128      proc variogram data=sashelp.thick outv=outv plots(only)=moran;
30129      compute lagd=7 maxlag=10 autocorr(assum=random);
30130      coordinates xc=East yc=North;
30131      var Thick;
30132      run;

NOTE: No DIRECTIONS statement and no NDIRECTIONS=, or NDIRECTIONS=0 specified: Computing omnidirectional semivariogram.
NOTE: The autocorrelation statistics exclude 33 observation(s) that have no neighbors within the specified LAGDISTANCE= distance.
NOTE: The Moran scatter plot excludes 33 observation(s) because they have no neighbors within the specified LAGDISTANCE= distance.
NOTE: The data set WORK.OUTV has 12 observations and 8 variables.
NOTE: The PROCEDURE VARIOGRAM printed pages 1837-1838.

30133      proc variogram data=sashelp.thick outv=outv;
30134      store out=SemivStoreGau / label='Thickness Gaussian WLS Fit';
30135      compute lagd=7 maxlag=10;
30136      coordinates xc=East yc=North;
30137      model form=gau cl / covb;
30138      var Thick;
30139      run;

NOTE: No DIRECTIONS statement and no NDIRECTIONS=, or NDIRECTIONS=0 specified: Computing omnidirectional semivariogram.
NOTE: Convergence criterion (GCONV=1E-8) satisfied.
NOTE: The data set WORK.OUTV has 12 observations and 8 variables.
NOTE: The PROCEDURE VARIOGRAM printed pages 1839-1842.

30140      ods graphics off;
30141      
30142      run; quit;
